OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1787055507
OL,3,CNew support pack for Type 2 diabetes
OL,4,Claunches in Wales
OL,6,FA new first-of-its-kind resource to
OL,7,Fsupport people diagnosed with Type 2
OL,8,Fdiabetes has been launched in Wales,
OL,9,Foffering practical advice for those
OL,10,Fmanaging a new diagnosis.
OL,12,FPublic Health Wales and Diabetes UK
OL,13,FCymru have launched new resources to
OL,14,Fsupport people newly diagnosed with
OL,15,FType 2 Diabetes in Wales.
OL,17,FThe support packs will aim to help
OL,18,Fpeople at the point of diagnosis of
OL,19,FType 2 diabetes, offering practical
OL,20,Fnext steps.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/6
