CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1787055507
OL,3,CNew support pack for Type 2 diabetes
OL,4,Claunches in Wales
OL,6,FIt will cover what happens after
OL,7,Fdiagnosis and advice for people living
OL,8,Fwith newly diagnosed Type 2 diabetes.
OL,10,FThe Point of Diagnosis packs, one for
OL,11,Fpatients and one for healthcare
OL,12,Fprofessionals, are the first
OL,13,Fnationally consistent resources in
OL,14,FWales designed specifically to support
OL,15,Fpeople at the point of diagnosis.
OL,17,FIt comes after the latest figures show
OL,18,Fthat Wales' diabetes crisis is growing
OL,19,Ffaster than predicted, with 230,371
OL,20,Fpeople in Wales living with diabetes.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1787055507
OL,3,CNew support pack for Type 2 diabetes
OL,4,Claunches in Wales
OL,6,FA further 328,000 people are estimated
OL,7,Fto be living with pre-diabetes or
OL,8,Fundiagnosed Type 2 diabetes.
OL,10,FResearch and patient engagement by the
OL,11,FTackling Diabetes Together Programme
OL,12,Fat Public Health Wales showed that the
OL,13,Fpoint of diagnosis is a critical
OL,14,Fmoment in shaping how people manage
OL,15,Ftheir condition over time.
OL,17,FThe new support packs are aimed at
OL,18,Fsupporting those at the point of
OL,19,Fdiagnosis of Type 2 diabetes.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
