FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1787055507
OL,3,CNew support pack for Type 2 diabetes
OL,4,Claunches in Wales
OL,6,FIt will include clear, practical
OL,7,Fguidance on food and lifestyle, better
OL,8,Funderstanding of what care and checks
OL,9,Fto expect, and greater awareness of
OL,10,Fhow managing their condition well can
OL,11,Fimprove their future health.
OL,13,FTalking about her Type 2 diabetes
OL,14,Fdiagnosis, south Wales resident, Tina
OL,15,FMoss, said: "I didn't have much
OL,16,Fsupport at all; I was sent away with a
OL,17,Fdiet and a pamphlet. The pack that's
OL,18,Fbeing launched tells you in so much
OL,19,Fdetail, and not just in medical jargon.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1787055507
OL,3,CNew support pack for Type 2 diabetes
OL,4,Claunches in Wales
OL,6,F"People don't know what to do, they
OL,7,Fdon't know what to cook and drink, we
OL,8,Fall need a little bit of help and
OL,9,Fsupport. I really wish I had that
OL,10,Fpack."
OL,12,FDavid Taylor, Transformation Director
OL,13,Fat the Tackling Diabetes Together
OL,14,FProgramme, Public Health Wales, said:
OL,15,F"Until now, the support people
OL,16,Freceived at a Type 2 diabetes
OL,17,Fdiagnosis depended too much on where
OL,18,Fthey lived and who they saw.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@FO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1787055507
OL,3,CNew support pack for Type 2 diabetes
OL,4,Claunches in Wales
OL,6,F"That variation wasn't fair, and it
OL,7,Fhad real consequences for people's
OL,8,Fhealth. These packs change that. They
OL,9,Fare built on what patients and
OL,10,Fclinicians told us they actually
OL,11,Fneeded, and they give people the
OL,12,Fknowledge and confidence to live well
OL,13,Fwith diabetes and prevent the
OL,14,Fcomplications that previous
OL,15,Fgenerations accepted as inevitable."
OL,17,FThe packs are now being embedded
OL,18,Facross NHS Wales, with the patient
OL,19,Fpacks available to view or download
OL,20,Fdirectly by searching: 'living well
OL,21,Fwith type 2 diabetes Wales'.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/6
